{"ticker":"KTOS","updated":"2026-11-14T01:10:26Z","profile":{"longName":"Kratos Defense & Security Solutions, Inc.","shortName":"Kratos Defense & Security Solut","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","country":"United States","website":"https://www.kratosdefense.com","fullTimeEmployees":4300,"marketCap":6384354304,"trailingPE":282.58334,"forwardPE":30.323353,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.8770597,"pegRatio":36.41,"targetMeanPrice":74.68,"targetHighPrice":120.0,"targetLowPrice":46.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":25,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.357,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.23021999,"operatingMargins":0.00789,"profitMargins":0.013359999,"totalRevenue":1646700032,"beta":1.165,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":134.0,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":31.57,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Kratos Defense & Security Solutions, Inc., a technology company, provides technology, hardware, products, system, and software for the defense, national security, and commercial markets in the United States, other North America, the Asia Pacific, the Middle East, Europe, and Internationally. The company operates through Kratos Government Solutions and Unmanned Systems segments. It offers virtualized ground systems for satellites and space vehicles, including software for command and control, telemetry, and tracking and control; jet powered unmanned aerial drone systems and hypersonic vehicles and rocket systems; propulsion systems for drones, missiles, loitering munitions, supersonic systems, spacecraft and launch systems, command, control, communication, computing, combat, and intelligence surveillance and reconnaissance; and microwave electronic products for missile, radar, missile defense, space, and satellite; and counter unmanned aircraft systems, directed energy, communication and other systems, and virtual and augmented reality training systems for the warfighter. In addition, It supplies turbine engines, engine components, accessories, and fuel management systems for PT6A, Twin-Pac, and JT15D aircraft engines. The company primarily serves national security-related agencies, the U.S. Department of Defense, intelligence and classified agencies, international government ag","summary_zh":"Kratos Defense & Security Solutions, Inc. 是一家技術公司，為美國、其他北美地區、亞太地區、中東、歐洲和國際的國防、國家安全和商業市場提供技術、硬體、產品、系統和軟體。該公司透過 Kratos Government Solutions 和 Unmanned Systems 部門營運。它為衛星和太空船提供虛擬地面系統，包括命令和控制、遙測以及追蹤和控制軟體；噴射動力無人機系統以及高超音速飛行器和火箭系統；無人機、飛彈、巡飛彈藥、超音速系統、太空船和發射系統、指揮、控制、通訊、計算、戰鬥以及情報監視和偵察的推進器；此外，該公司還為 PT6A、Twin-Pac 和 JT15D 飛機發動機提供渦輪發動機、發動機部件、配件和燃油管理系統。該公司主要服務於國家安全相關機構、美國國防部、情報和機密機構、國際政府機構","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"航空航太與國防","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":69.45,"h":71.31,"l":67.9,"c":70.74,"v":3391900},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":71.06,"h":76.62,"l":70.83,"c":76.35,"v":5322900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":75.01,"h":77.03,"l":73.11,"c":75.74,"v":4247200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":76.65,"h":81.44,"l":75.02,"c":80.65,"v":4310100},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":81.52,"h":82.31,"l":79.9,"c":80.77,"v":35427700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":80.61,"h":82.63,"l":79.3,"c":80.72,"v":6450300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":81.1,"h":85.48,"l":81.1,"c":83.9,"v":4998300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":84.37,"h":85.0,"l":80.85,"c":81.18,"v":3738100},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":80.0,"h":84.88,"l":78.87,"c":84.2,"v":4291100},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":85.0,"h":86.84,"l":84.43,"c":86.28,"v":3009500},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":88.95,"h":89.67,"l":87.8,"c":88.08,"v":4535800},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":88.39,"h":91.87,"l":88.1,"c":91.37,"v":4542300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":90.5,"h":93.52,"l":88.63,"c":92.96,"v":3855300},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":95.0,"h":96.4,"l":92.53,"c":95.03,"v":2952200},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":95.69,"h":98.12,"l":93.86,"c":96.19,"v":3408300},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":98.35,"h":103.0,"l":98.02,"c":100.25,"v":5021900},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":101.15,"h":104.71,"l":100.0,"c":103.69,"v":5802000},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":103.07,"h":106.31,"l":101.9,"c":105.67,"v":4069900},{"t":"2025-10-0